  "body": "We should specify the `client_max_body_size` nginx option and equivalent for other reverse proxies in https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/master/docs/reverse_proxy.md so people don't get caught up when they can't upload large images (and Synapse doesn't report an error).\r\n\r\nAlso client developers should interpret the 413 from the reverse proxy as the image is too large...",
